{"product_id":"jeff-browns-flat-stanley-the-great-egyptian-grave-robbery","title":"Jeff Brown's Flat Stanley: The Great Egyptian Grave Robbery","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlat Stanley is back! Ever since Stanley was flattened by a bulletin board, there are places he can get to that no one else can. So when Stanley receives a letter from an archaeologist, he travels by airmail to Egypt to help find an ancient treasure deep in the heart of a great pyramid. But what if even the flattest boy on earth can't wriggle out of this dark tomb - and the terrible mess he finds himself in?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 197 x 7\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jeff Brown\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405252096\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45297386487961,"sku":"16RD-1-9781405252096","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/v.jpg?v=1744475878","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/jeff-browns-flat-stanley-the-great-egyptian-grave-robbery","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}